---
// AboutPeoplePromises.astro - Our People and Promises Section with 3D Book Mockup
---

<section class="w-full bg-white py-16 sm:py-24 text-slate-900 font-montserrat border-t border-slate-100 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-[1350px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Copy & Promises -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
        
        <!-- Main Headline -->
        <h2 class="font-nunito font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-[44px] leading-tight text-slate-900 tracking-tight line-clamp-2">
          Our People and Promises
        </h2>

        <!-- Subheading -->
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-[#3D2E61] uppercase tracking-wider">
          A publishing partnership built on integrity and craft
        </p>

        <!-- Paragraphs -->
        <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 font-normal leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Behind every published title at Fleck Publisher is an obsessive team of developmental editors, award-winning book designers, typesetters, and launch strategists working together to ensure your book stands toe-to-toe with Big-5 releases.
          </p>
          <p>
            We promise total creative and royalty ownership, zero hidden fees, meticulous attention to global formatting standards, and proactive guidance from manuscript delivery to global bookshelf launch. You set the vision—we deliver the execution.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- CTA Button -->
        <div class="pt-2">
          <a 
            href="/contact" 
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-7 py-3 bg-[#3D2E61] hover:bg-[#4d3a7a] active:scale-[0.99] text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow-md transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer"
          >
            Talk to Our Team
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: 3D Hardcover Book Mockup with Custom Sprayed Edge -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex justify-center lg:justify-end items-center">
        <div class="relative max-w-[400px] sm:max-w-[440px] hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300">
          <img 
            src="/image 21.png" 
            alt="Fleck Publisher Premier Hardcover Production - The Witch" 
            class="w-full h-auto object-contain select-none block"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
